1404..1482 Comment "/// typed at the motive at `q`, where the arm owes the motive at `loop ∷ q`:"
1483..1562 Comment "/// a path from `loop ∷ spin(wind(q))` to `loop ∷ q`. The two path types do"
1563..1603 Comment "/// not convert, and the arm is refused."
